Package: a-nas
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: A-NAS <zhongwater123@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: a-nas-host (= @VERSION@), systemd (>= 257), python3, @CONTENT@
Description: the A-NAS product
 The Host Agent, the Product Service and its photo, share and family
 services, the AI Worker, web search, the vector index and the local
 console's launcher, with their systemd units, accounts and directories
 (docs/adr/0034). The models, runtimes, Qdrant and llama.cpp are content
 packages of their own, and the Debian packages the product runs on come
 with a-nas-host. This machine's settings are in /etc/a-nas/site.conf,
 which the package never writes; a-nas-check tells whether the product
 works.
